{"id":"7854b320fddf7289","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Premouse Code","display":"df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code — ZFC Inner2 Premouse Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code — ZFC Inner2 Premouse Code","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code — ZFC Inner2 Premouse Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (candidate code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (premouse universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E\">\\(\\vec E\\)</span> (extender sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\)</span> (premouse predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PremouseCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{PremouseCode}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\operatorname{PremouseCode}(c,M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow c=\\langle M,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\operatorname{PremouseCode}(c,M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow c=\\langle M,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ordered pair codes a premouse already validated by the canonical premouse predicate. The bare equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=L[E]\">\\(M=L[E]\\)</span> neither typed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> nor expressed the premouse axioms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Premouse}_S$ (premouse predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PremouseCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\operatorname{PremouseCode}(c,M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow c=\\langle M,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)","display":true},{"tex":"M=L[E]","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":993,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2358","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code.md|58-df-zfc-inner2-premouse-code]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["ab819650b6d5d52d"]}